WEBVTT

00:01:28.786 --> 00:01:30.192
je dovoljno prašine preostalo

00:01:30.192 --> 00:01:32.158
pa se ne upali u zvijezdu,

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.158
već postane planet.

00:01:34.158 --> 00:01:38.983
A to se dogodilo prije malo više od 4 milijarde godina.

00:01:38.983 --> 00:01:40.416
A uskoro nakon toga

00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:42.333
preostalo je dovoljno materijala

00:01:42.333 --> 00:01:46.896
da dobijete svemirsku juhu,

00:01:46.896 --> 00:01:48.660
iz koje nastaje život.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:52.541
I život se počne širiti i širiti,

00:01:52.541 --> 00:01:54.292
dok ne ode k vragu.

00:01:54.292 --> 00:01:57.780
(Smijeh)

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.210
Zbilja je neobično što

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:02.116
život ne ode k vragu jednom, dvaput,